          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1769048175785,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2️⃣ etcd\nRole: Database\n- Stores:\n    - Pods\n    - Services\n    - Configs\n    - Secrets\nKey–Value store\n-> Kubernetes state = etcd\n->  If etcd is lost → cluster memory is gone",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2️⃣ etcd\nRole: Database\n- Stores:\n    - Pods\n    - Services\n    - Configs\n    - Secrets\nKey–Value store\n-> Kubernetes state = etcd\n->  If etcd is lost → cluster memory is gone",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
