        }
      ],
      "updated": 1769048270813,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3️⃣ kube-scheduler\nRole: Decision maker 🎯\n- When a Pod is created, it decides:\n    - Which node should run it?\n- Looks at:\n    - CPU\n    - Memory\n    - Node availability\n->  Scheduler = “Best node chooser”",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3️⃣ kube-scheduler\nRole: Decision maker 🎯\n- When a Pod is created, it decides:\n    - Which node should run it?\n- Looks at:\n    - CPU\n    - Memory\n    - Node availability\n->  Scheduler = “Best node chooser”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
