      ],
      "updated": 1769048516316,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1️⃣ kubelet\nRole: Node agent 🤖\n- Runs on every worker node\n- Talks to API Server\n- Makes sure:\n    - Pods are running\n    - Containers are healthy\n-> kubelet = manager of this node",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1️⃣ kubelet\nRole: Node agent 🤖\n- Runs on every worker node\n- Talks to API Server\n- Makes sure:\n    - Pods are running\n    - Containers are healthy\n-> kubelet = manager of this node",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
