        }
      ],
      "updated": 1769048798510,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3️⃣ Pods\nSmallest unit in Kubernetes\n- Pod = one or more containers\n- Containers in a Pod:\n    - Share IP\n    - Share storage\n-> Kubernetes does NOT run containers directly\n-> It runs Pods",
      "fontSize": 16.03761574074074,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3️⃣ Pods\nSmallest unit in Kubernetes\n- Pod = one or more containers\n- Containers in a Pod:\n    - Share IP\n    - Share storage\n-> Kubernetes does NOT run containers directly\n-> It runs Pods",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
