      "updated": 1769049054909,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4️⃣ kube-proxy\nRole: Networking traffic \n- Handles:\n    - Service → Pod routing\n    - Load balancing\n - Uses iptables / IPVS\n-> kube-proxy = traffic police ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4️⃣ kube-proxy\nRole: Networking traffic \n- Handles:\n    - Service → Pod routing\n    - Load balancing\n - Uses iptables / IPVS\n-> kube-proxy = traffic police ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
